[6.043649, "o", "# Enrichment API\r\n\r\nBase URL is provided by the `API_BASE` environment variable.\r\n\r\n## GET /enrich\r\n\r\nEnriches one record.\r\n\r\nQuery parameter:\r\n\r\n```text\r\n"]
[6.04376, "o", "record_id\r\n```\r\n\r\nDocumented limit: 2 requests per second.\r\n\r\n## POST /batch_enrich\r\n\r\nEnriches multiple records in one request.\r\n\r\nJSON body:\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"record_ids\": [1, 2, 3]\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nMaximum batch size: 100.\r\n\r\nDocumented limit: 5 requests per second.\r\n"]
[6.044072, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[6.044126, "o", "root@87be788e417d:/app# "]
[6.138403, "i", "find /app -maxdepth 3 -type f | sed 's#^/app/##' | sort | head -200\n"]
